<title>FINLAND: Finland Bank seen buying marks for markka - dealers.</title>
<headline>Finland Bank seen buying marks for markka - dealers.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland intervened in the foreign exchange markets on Tuesday, buying German marks for markka at around 3.0050, attempting to prevent the markka from strengthening further, foreign exchange dealers said.</p>
</text>
